              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye avayo ajya i Beteli. Akiri mu nzira azamuka, haza abahungu bavuye mu mudugudu baramuseka, baramubwira bati “Zamuka wa munyaruhara we! Zamuka wa munyaruhara we!”",
          "type": "text",
